@startuml
title GKE Pub/Sub WebSocket Adapter - System Architecture

left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif

actor "Web Client\n(Browser / WebSocket)" as Client

rectangle "Google Cloud Platform" {
  component "Pub/Sub Topic\nprojects/<project-id>/topics/<topic-name>\n[SI-001 / DI-001 / DR-003]" as Topic
}

rectangle "Google Kubernetes Engine" {

  component "Kubernetes ConfigMap\nitem: topic = <topic-id>\n[SI-003 / DR-001]" as CM

  component "LoadBalancer Service\nTCP port 80 -> targetPort 8080\n[SI-005 / FR-005 / CI-002 / NFR-004]" as SVC

  component "HorizontalPodAutoscaler\nmin 1 / max 2 / CPU 80%\n[SI-006 / FR-009 / NFR-001]" as HPA

  component "Adapter Deployment\n(one configured topic per instance)\n[FR-003 / DR-006]" as DEP {

    component "Adapter Pod :8080\n[FR-007 / NFR-002]" as POD {

      component "exec.sh\ncontainer entrypoint\n[CON-006 / FR-002]" as EXEC

      component "pulltop (Node.js)\npulls topic, writes output stream\n[SI-002 / DR-007]" as PULL

      component "Recent-Message Cache\nup to last 10 messages\n[DI-003 / FR-008 / NFR-003]" as CACHE

      component "websocketd\nlistens on :8080\n[CI-003 / FR-002]" as WS
    }
  }
}

Client --> SVC : WebSocket connection\n[UI-001 / CI-001 / FR-001 / NFR-005]
SVC --> POD : forward TCP 8080\n[FR-006 / CI-002]
HPA --> DEP : scales replicas\n[FR-009 / NFR-001]
CM ..> DEP : SYMBOL environment variable\n[SI-004 / FR-004 / DR-002]
DEP --> Topic : one subscription per running instance\n[SI-001 / SI-002 / FR-007 / NFR-002]
EXEC --> PULL : starts with SYMBOL topic parameter\n[FR-002 / DR-002]
PULL --> CACHE : stores recent messages\n[FR-008 / DR-005]
PULL --> WS : runtime output stream\n[CI-003 / DR-007]
CACHE --> WS : serves cached messages on connect\n[FR-008 / DI-003]

note right of DEP
  FR-010 / CON-001..003: deployment requires a GCP
  project with billing enabled, topic read access,
  and Pub/Sub subscription creation permission.
  CON-008: client-count autoscaling not assumed.
end note

@enduml
